    "abstract": "On Thursday, September 23, 1993, Sydney was proclaimed the winner in the contest as to which city would host the Olympic Games in the year 2000. It is anticipated that some form of HDTV will be extensively used to cover these Games. Coverage by HDTV has grown at each Games since Los Angeles in 1984. The Barcelona Games saw both the 1125/60 and the 1250/50 systems used and broadcast by satellites in Europe and Japan.",
